  "detail_text": "Synopsis - SPRDL1-26-R-0079 This posting is a synopsis, not an official RFP. DLAWS (Warren) anticipates issuing a solicitation that will result in a Firm-Fixed Price contract for the following item: Noun: Track Shoe, Vehicular NSN: 2530-01-346-9233 Part Number (P/N): 12268550-1 Total Quantity: 30,960 each (Base Qty 15,480 ea / Option Qty 15,480 ea) Packaging: Military A FOB: Origin (complete FS6245, FS7033, FS7202) This solicitation is Full and Open Competition. TDP/SPI: Technical Data and Special Packaging Instructions are available. This is a Qualified Product List (QPL) Item. The solicitation should be released to the web on or about 15 days from this notification posting. Once available, the solicitation can be downloaded from SAM.gov (https://www.SAM.gov). See the solicitation for the actual closing date.",
